<div class="notice"><p>Set is_active to yes, true or 1 to publish products on the website; no, false or 0 keeps them hidden. Values are case-insensitive. Blank flags preserve existing values; new products default to draft and not featured. Blank slugs are generated from product names. Existing publication schedules remain in effect.</p><p>Missing brands, categories and subcategories are shown in the preview and created as published entries only when you confirm. Existing entries keep their current publishing status. A category is required when creating a subcategory.</p><p>Images are optional. Upload them to the Media Library and use their original filenames or media IDs in the image column, or add images later with Bulk Images. Blank images preserve existing images. The importer does not download external images.</p></div>
